  <item>
    <title>VOL 29｜《苦尽柑来遇见你》：只有东亚人才懂的苦与甘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680758b7cdd692da15f3ae6c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680758b7cdd692da15f3ae6c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Apr 2025 09:04:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在我的“处心积虑”下，成功让庄生看完了《苦尽柑来遇见你》，并且一起录制了这期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这部剧带来的苦与甘、带来的回味，真的太想聊一聊了！ 文字就不多写了，想说的都在节目里了!</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>附上大结局的最后一首诗：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>献给走过四季的父母</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>曾经那么年轻</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>现在依旧温柔</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我满怀悔恨、感激与最深的敬意</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>感谢你们走过的所有风风雨雨</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">00:05:22</a> 这部剧是“苦难叙事”吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">00:08:25</a> 百变演员&amp;百变妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">00:12:32</a> 最爱的光礼妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">00:19:08</a> 离我们最近的爱纯妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">00:27:53</a> 配角妈妈们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">00:39:53</a> 两代人的“苦”有何不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2839">00:47:19</a> 每个女儿都有一次父亲来访的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">00:54:32</a> 群体的互帮互助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3568">00:59:28</a> “宽植”真的存在吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4040">01:07:20</a> 这部剧巧妙的叙事结构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4611">01:16:51</a> 这剧的不足之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5839">01:37:19</a> 爱纯的原型人物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5956">01:39:16</a> 真实的海女</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——本期嘉宾——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6167f5b52af167877cd512ea" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6167f5b52af167877cd512ea"><span>一梦百晓</span></a><span>主播：庄生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——本期节目提到的作品——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《分手的决心》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《甄嬛传》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《海边的曼彻斯特》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《海女》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《摇晃的灵魂》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《请回答1988》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——BGM——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>추다혜 - 청춘가</span></p><span></span><p><span>崔白虎 - 희망의 나라로</span></p><span></span><p><span>IU&amp;Hyein&amp;赵元善 - Shh</span></p><span></span><p><span>Judah Earl - 그렇게 눕고 또 일어났다</span></p>]]></description>
