  <item>
    <title>VOL 24｜《装腔启示录》（上）：终于有编剧是上过班的！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/651d44d919dde7bf6af88c0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">651d44d919dde7bf6af88c0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Oct 2023 10:56:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2023年的第一更来啦！对不起，我为今年的摆烂道个歉！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目是三人串台，聊一聊近期的国产电视剧：《装腔启示录》。第一集女主角在飞机上拿着英文书发朋友圈的镜头，一下吸引了我，戳到了多少“装X人”的脊梁骨？尤其剧中真实的职场戏，让我们三人惊呼，终于有编剧是上过班的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目分为上下两集，本期为上集。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">00:05:20</a> 原小说作者的背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">00:09:37</a> 主播们装腔的事例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">00:18:40</a> 职场上如果要求穿戴名牌，你会怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">00:21:37</a> 装腔应该要被看出来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">00:27:30</a> 被别人装腔的事例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">00:33:01</a> 剧中的黄金配角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">00:43:25</a> 剧情给人强烈的职场代入感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3206">00:53:26</a> 为什么非要叫英文名？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3823">01:03:43</a> 剧中社畜的生理疾病</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——本期嘉宾——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6167f5b52af167877cd512ea?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6167f5b52af167877cd512ea?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D"><span>一梦百晓</span></a><span>”主播：庄生</span></p><span></span><p><span>“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/618641a62f5e3013453e669a?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/618641a62f5e3013453e669a?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D"><span>饮杯酒先</span></a><span>”主播：小林</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——BGM——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《独享双人舞》</span></p>]]></description>
