  <item>
    <title>VOL 17｜暑假啦，追忆难忘的“儿童文学”（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62e8b9939f87279faacd886d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62e8b9939f87279faacd886d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Aug 2022 05:43:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6105f19e3902ef23928621a9?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6105f19e3902ef23928621a9?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D"><span>鬼说梦话</span></a><span>》×《三下五除二》，熟悉的配方又出现啦！我们仨再次聊了关于文学的话题，这一次，是伴随我们成长的“儿童文学”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>友情提示：</span></strong><span>本期节目结尾有有奖竞猜环节，快来让主播圆梦！欢迎听众朋友们多多参与！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">00:01:15</a> 改编成影视作品的儿童文学作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">00:02:22</a> 惊悚恐怖悬疑小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">00:08:06</a> 我们小时候订阅过的杂志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">00:12:41</a> 《儿童文学》杂志变迁史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">00:15:50</a> 让我们重读曾经喜欢的文学片段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">00:35:01</a>“儿童文学”这一类别为何存在&amp;教科书的选文标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">00:48:07</a> 成年人还能从儿童文学中获益吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3209">00:53:29</a> 征文悬赏</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;——本期嘉宾——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6105f19e3902ef23928621a9?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6105f19e3902ef23928621a9?s=eyJ1IjoiNWU1ZDZiYmE5ODQ1MzI3YWU2YjM1ZWViIn0%3D"><span>“鬼说梦话”</span></a><span> 主播：阿鬼、梦梦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;——BGM——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《The Edge》by _91nova -</span></p><span></span><p><span>《A Catalogue Of Afternoons》by Max Richter</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Fox Tracks》by Ludovico Einaudi / Redi Hasa / Federico Mecozzi</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Les personnages d'une vie》by Baptiste Thiry</span></p><span></span><p><span>《빛》by 김지애 (金智爱)</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一诺千金》by JOGGER 熊 / 欠拍的黄瓜 / 不思异TV</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Jess Returns Home (feat. Dot Allison)》by Christian Henson</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The Castle of Mole》by 肖华</span></p><span></span><p><span>《眼保健操（1988版母带无损）》by Windows95</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fnbbs19lQnEyCGywGdzzltFjEF-F.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;——本期节目提到的杂志——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《童话大王》《少年博览》《少男少女》《中国少年文摘》《萌芽》《儿童文学》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;——本期节目提到的影视作品——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《舒克和贝塔》《乱世佳人》《哈利·波特》《魔方大厦》《邋遢大王奇遇记》《女生日记》</span></p>]]></description>
